Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On today's episode of the MMO Stream,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll be covering the internationally\Nfamous Sword Art Online, a .k .a.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.05,0:00:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FAO. Up to now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.71,0:00:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,none of the Nerf Gear\Nsoftware we've seen has taken
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,advantage of the\Npossibilities of the hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.39,0:00:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm off to practice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.83,0:00:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by the inventor of their\Ngear, Akihiko Gabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.89,0:01:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heck, this is the VR MMORPG that me and\Neveryone else have been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.69,0:01:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beta testers say it's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.97,0:01:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have gotten one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first testing was limited\Nto only 10,000 copies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fans in line snapped them up, and\Nonline the game sold out in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Link, start!
