Dialogue: 3,0:02:26.00,0:02:30.00,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,813,1920,816)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA819&}The World Of Swords
Dialogue: 3,0:02:26.00,0:02:30.00,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,816,1920,819)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA818&}The World Of Swords
Dialogue: 3,0:02:26.00,0:02:30.00,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,819,1920,822)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA717&}The World Of Swords
Dialogue: 3,0:02:26.00,0:02:30.00,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,822,1920,825)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA616&}The World Of Swords
Dialogue: 3,0:02:26.00,0:02:30.00,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,825,1920,828)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA616&}The World Of Swords
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.29,0:02:32.75,text1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx90\fscy85\blur3\yshad3.75\1a&HFE\4a&H22\pos(960,937.5)}1st Floor • Town of Beginnings
Dialogue: 2,0:02:30.29,0:02:32.75,text1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\alpha&H11&\fscx90\fscy85\blur0.6\shad0\c&HFBFEFF&\pos(960,937.5)}1st Floor • Town of Beginnings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.47,0:02:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I told him, so it's his deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we form a party?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know, maybe.\NOh, come on. It'll be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can go out and do that bad stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Froze! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.13,0:02:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You act like you know\Nyour way around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were in the beta test, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:02:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's my first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, could you give me some\Ntips on the lower floors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know if...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, please, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, my name's Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.97,0:03:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm Kirito.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.84,0:03:21.31,text1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,450)\fscx90\fscy85\blur3\yshad3.75\1a&HFE\4a&H22\pos(960,937.5)}1st Floor • Town of Beginnings, West Field
Dialogue: 2,0:03:17.84,0:03:21.31,text1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,450)\alpha&H11&\fscx90\fscy85\blur0.6\shad0\c&HFBFEFF&\pos(960,937.5)}1st Floor • Town of Beginnings, West Field
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right in the nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't feel any pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.55,0:03:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first move is the most important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.89,0:03:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.91,0:03:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he won't stand still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do your initial motion right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and activate a sword\Nskill at the right time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The system pretty much guarantees\Nyou'll always hit your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Initial motion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:03:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's an easier way to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right after you start your\Nmove, wait for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you feel the skills start\Nto activate, drive it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drive it home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaaah! Yaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.03,0:04:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that boar's about as weak\Nas slimes in other games are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.77,0:04:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, you gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.51,0:04:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that thing was a mid-level boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, as if.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.11,0:04:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Addictive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:04:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.89,0:05:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these skills, there's a ton of them,\Nlike blacksmithing and stuff, right? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the game has an\Nunlimited number of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.15,0:05:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All except for magic, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.57,0:05:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An RPG without magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a bold decision, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.23,0:05:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of fun to move your\Nbody as you fight, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hells yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready to move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I look around, I can't\Nbelieve it—we're inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a game bro whoever made\Nit's a genius this thing's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.61,0:05:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,amazing makes me glad I\Nwas born when I was you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know it's not that big\Na deal cut me some slack
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's my first full dive\Nyou never used the nerve
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.57,0:06:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gear before today huh\Nthis is your first time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever uh-huh as soon as\NI got the money together
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I rushed out and bought all\Nthe hardware to play SAO
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stood in line and scored one\Nof the 10,000 hard copies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you could say I was pretty lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, you, sir, were ten times\Nas lucky getting the beta tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.89,0:06:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, only a thousand\Npeople got the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess I was lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.65,0:06:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mind if I ask how\Nfar you got in the beta?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two months and I couldn't\Nget further than Floor 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I think I can\Nget there within a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds to me like you're really into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.37,0:06:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the beta test, SAO was the\Nonly thing on my mind, day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this world, a single blade can\Ntake you anywhere you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even though it's a virtual world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel more alive in here than\NI ever did in the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you want to go\Ndo some more hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the thing is, I'm really hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.79,0:07:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad the food you eat here only\Nsatisfies your hunger virtually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for reals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I ordered a pizza for 5:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're so prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, the game can wait\Nuntil I get my pizza on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.31,0:07:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was going to go meet up with\Nsome people I know from another game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're up\Nto after this, so if, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know, if you want, you can\Nfriend him and hang with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.99,0:07:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's cool if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always introduce you to\Nhim another time or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.65,0:07:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.56,0:07:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be doing all the thanking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, one of these days, I promise\NI'll pay you back for all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Virtually, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.85,0:07:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.23,0:07:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll see you around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's anything else you\Nwant to know, message me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.41,0:08:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd the logout button go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.51,0:08:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, it's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.85,0:08:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be at the\Nbottom of the main menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.75,0:08:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, today's what,\Nthe first day out of beta?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's bound to be some bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.59,0:08:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet the server people\Nare freaking out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will too. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.15,0:08:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's 525.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, my teriyaki\Nmayo pizza and gingerbread!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.05,0:08:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just\Ncontact the Game Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did that, but nothing's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not picking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:09:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know if there's another\Nway to log out of this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.57,0:09:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, whenever a player\Nwants to log out of SAO,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.73,0:09:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only way they can do it\Nis by going through the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be some other way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return! Log out! Escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there was no emergency\Nlogout in the manual either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way. You're kidding. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.95,0:09:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just rip the nerve gear\Noff my head. Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you're hooked in, you can't move\Nyour body in the real world anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nerve gear intercepts all\Nthe commands you give from
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inside the game using an\Ninterface built into the rig.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.49,0:09:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now we gotta wait until someone\Ngets around to fixing the bug?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.43,0:09:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or until someone in the real world comes\Nalong and takes the nerve gear off us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I live alone. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a mom and a sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.27,0:10:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm pretty sure they'll notice\Nby dinnertime and come look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a sister? How old's she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.93,0:10:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's she like?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's into sports and hates games,\Nand she's totally not your type, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't date a gamer\Nif he's the last guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, getting kicked\Nin the balls doesn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.55,0:10:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think this is weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.49,0:10:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's just a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.49,0:10:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't just a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.37,0:10:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can't log out, it's going to cause\Nsome serious problems for the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.61,0:10:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the developers\Neven know what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they could just shut down\Nthe server and log everyone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why haven't they made an announcement?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.93,0:11:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh, someone forced a teleport.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.11,0:11:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on with you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.93,0:11:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.01,0:11:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.93,0:11:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the game master?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't he have a face?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this an event?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just part of the opening ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.59,0:12:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention, players.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I welcome you to my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.23,0:12:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Akihiko Kayaba, and as of this\Nmoment, I am in control of this world.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.39,0:12:26.01,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an5\c&H000000&\blur1.65\pos(880.5,721.5)\fnRaavi\fs57\frz344.1}« Sword Art • Online »
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.39,0:12:26.01,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an5\c&H0B090B&\blur1.65\b1\fs60\frz343.72\fnRaavi\pos(1021.5,853.5)}Development Director
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.39,0:12:26.01,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an5\c&H0B090B&\blur1.65\b1\fs78\frz343.83\fnRaavi\pos(840,879)}Kayaba  Akihiko
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure most of you have already noticed\Nan item missing from your main menus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.47,0:12:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the logout button.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.01,0:12:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me assure you, this is\Nnot a defect in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I repeat, this is not a defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.91,0:12:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how Sword Art\NOnline was designed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot log yourselves out of SAO?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.91,0:12:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and no one from the outside\Nwill be able to shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or remove the nerve gear from your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone attempts to do so,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a transmitter inside the nerve gear\Nwill discharge a microwave signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into your skull, destroying your\Nbrain, and ending your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.23,0:13:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's such BS.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.01,0:13:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.13,0:13:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I can't get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got to be nuts, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Kirito? He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The transmitter signals in the\Nheadgear work just like microwaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the safety's disabled,\Nit could fry your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.65,0:13:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't someone cut the power, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Nervegear's got an internal battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's totally crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite my warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the families and friends of some of the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.31,0:13:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,players have attempted\Nremoving the Nervegear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.73,0:13:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An unfortunate decision, to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.83,0:13:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a result, the game now has 213\Nless players than when it began.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been deleted from both\NAincrad and the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,213?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.97,0:14:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,international media outlets have\Nround-the-clock coverage of everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.31,0:14:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including the deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.19,0:14:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.37,0:14:18.34,news,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\p1\bord0\shad0\move(499.5,387,189,451.5)\c&HCF6C83&\t(\fscx97\fscy100)}m 0 0 l 28.5 -58.5 l 298.5 -108 l 267 -49.5 l 0 0
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.37,0:14:18.34,news,,0,0,0,,{\frz359.69\p1\blur1.5\bord0\shad0\move(909,1018.5,585,1065)\c&HDFD2C0&\iclip(m 1314 687 b 1338 688.5 1336.5 666 1344 660 1348.5 654 1345.5 682.5 1347 690)\t(\fscx96\fscy100\frz359.69)}m 0 0 b -18 -28.5 -22.5 -94.5 -19.5 -118.5 b 268.5 -159 556.5 -198 841.5 -234 b 852 -190.5 861 -156 859.5 -106.5 b 574.5 -69 288 -34.5 0 0
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.37,0:14:18.34,news2,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx100\fscy110\fax-0.15\fsp-1.5\be2\alpha&H11\bord1.5\blur0.75\3c&H91587E&\move(504,240,193.5,304.5)\frz10.54\c&HD4C9DF&\t(\fscx97)}More Victims in Nagoya
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.37,0:14:18.34,news2,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fax-0.1\fsp-1.5\fscx175\fscy175\bord4.5\fay0.03\c&HE3DCF5&\3c&H997177&\frx2\fry357\move(873,679.5,547.5,726)\frz8.72\t(\fscx169\fscy175)}Deaths caused by online game continue to rise
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's safe to assume the likelihood of a\NNervegear being removed is minimal at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this brings you a little\Ncomfort as you try to clear the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important you remember the following.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no longer any way to\Nrevive someone within the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.45,0:14:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your HP drops to zero, your avatar\Nwill be deleted from the system forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.13,0:14:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the nerve gear will\Nsimultaneously destroy your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.07,0:15:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way for\Na player to escape now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must clear the game\Nright now you're gathered
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.81,0:15:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on floor one the lowest\Nlevel of aincrad if you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can get through the dungeon\Nand defeat the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.67,0:15:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may advance to the next floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeat the boss on floor 100, and\Nyou will clear the game. Clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should we believe any\Nof the crap you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't clear all hundred floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's freaking impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the beta testers\Nnever made it that high!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.77,0:15:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last but not least,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've placed a little present in\Nthe item storage of every player.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.11,0:15:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mirror?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.88,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fscy120\fax0.01\blur1.5\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&HCBCBCC&\frz349.1\bord0.45\3c&HC8C7C9&\pos(1190.67,477.33)}Mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.03,0:15:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay, Kirito? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.23,0:16:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm me. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.65,0:16:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not 17!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.47,0:16:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.79,0:16:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that you calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a high-density signal\Ndevice inside the nerve gear rig.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can see what my face looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.85,0:16:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how's it know my height and body type?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you first put the\Nnerve gear on it had to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.73,0:16:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do this calibration thing\Nit asked you to touch
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your body all over like\Nthis remember oh yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.51,0:16:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're right that's where\Nit got our physical data
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this is what's the\Npoint why would anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:16:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do this to us i think\Nhe's about to tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right now you're probably\Nwondering why why would
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,akihiko kayaba developer\Nof sword art online and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.19,0:17:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NerveGear does this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.61,0:17:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, my goal was a simple one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.21,0:17:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason I created Sword Art Online was
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.35,0:17:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to control the fate of\Na world of my design.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I have achieved my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.93,0:17:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This marks the end of the tutorial and\Nthe official launch of Sword Art Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Players, I wish you the best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akihiko Kayaba created a virtual world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He designed the NerveGear rig.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man's a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been a fan of his for\Na long time, so I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything he just said is the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.12,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an5\c&H000000&\blur1.65\pos(880.5,721.5)\fnRaavi\fs57\frz344.1}« Sword Art • Online »
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.12,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an5\c&H0B090B&\blur1.65\b1\fs60\frz343.72\fnRaavi\pos(1021.5,853.5)}Development Director
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.12,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an5\c&H0B090B&\blur1.65\b1\fs78\frz343.83\fnRaavi\pos(840,879)\fsp}Kayaba  Akihiko
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.12,0:18:27.62,char-menu,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H090909&\b1\fscx125\fscy135\frz347.73\pos(1026,261)}This is a game, but it's not just something you play.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.12,0:18:27.62,char-menu,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H090909&\b1\fscx110\fscy115\fry-2\frz348.96\pos(768,927)\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro-En H}『{\fnWasco Sans}Sword Art Online{\fnIwata Mincho Old Pro-En H}』 {\fnWasco Sans}Programmer Kayaba Akihiko
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I die in the game,\NI'll die in real life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.85,0:18:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.17,0:18:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.27,0:18:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.65,0:18:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a meeting after this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop pushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did we ever do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just wanted to play a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.65,0:18:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:18:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out right\Nnow for the next village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.13,0:19:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to come. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If what he said is\Ntrue, and I think it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only way we're\Ngoing to survive in here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is by making ourselves\Nas strong as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In an MMORPG, the money\Nyou can earn, the XP,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.61,0:19:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once the game starts up, there's only\Nso much of that stuff to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.65,0:19:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the fields around the Town of\NBeginnings are going to be hunted clean soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we head to the next village now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.59,0:19:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have an easier time\Ncollecting cash and points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I know all the\Npaths and places we should avoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm level one,\NI can get there easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but you know those friends\Nof mine I was telling you about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.27,0:19:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stood in line for a whole\Nnight to buy this, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're back at the plaza somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I can't leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:20:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it were just Klein, but two\Nmore, or even one more... Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.79,0:20:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't ask a guy I just met to risk his\Nlife for a bunch of strangers, can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.49,0:20:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your ass to the next village.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.05,0:20:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last game I played, I ran a\Nguild, so I'm more than prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with all the stuff you\Ntaught me, I'll get by, no sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.41,0:20:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, I'll get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.75,0:20:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you're in a jam,\Nmessage me, okay? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.41,0:20:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be seeing you, Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.09,0:20:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.19,0:20:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.79,0:20:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, you look better like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way cooler than your avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I think that scruffy face\Nfits you ten times better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world can't beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.21,0:21:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will survive!
